  "remarks": "Denis Merzlikin is the founder and director of the LLC “ASFPV”, a Russian company that manufactures drones (“Veterok 7”, “Veterok10”, and “Veterok 13”), drone detectors (Gorn), and fibre-optic spools for the Russian Armed Forces. These drones, drone detectors and fibre-optic spools are used in Russia’s war of aggression against Ukraine.",
